CGS Pvt. Ltd., founded in 2012, is a garment manufacturer specialising in mid-fashion garments and producing for some European brands. The company is covered under the MSME limit. It has a working capital loan and a term loan of ₹10 crores. The corporate debtor was doing well, but due to the coronavirus pandemic, it went into a liquidity crunch on account of small revenue and high fixed costs and was therefore unable to repay the interest and instalments of the loan to the bank. Th…";}s:8:"internal";a:2:{s:5:"cache";b:1;s:3:"toc";b:1;}s:8:"relation";a:1:{s:10:"firstimage";s:0:"";}s:11:"last_change";a:10:{s:4:"date";i:1760534216;s:2:"ip";s:9:"127.0.0.1";s:4:"type";s:1:"C";s:2:"id";s:49:"resources:case_studies:financial_securities:case4";s:4:"user";s:0:"";s:3:"sum";s:23:"created - external edit";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";s:10:"sizechange";i:5022;s:9:"timestamp";i:1760534216;s:4:"mode";s:4:"page";}s:6:"plugin";a:1:{s:13:"plugin_acmenu";a:1:{s:6:"sub_ns";a:4:{i:0;s:43:"resources:case_studies:financial_securities";i:1;s:22:"resources:case_studies";i:2;s:9:"resources";i:3;s:0:"";}}}}s:10:"persistent";a:4:{s:4:"date";a:1:{s:7:"created";i:1760534216;}s:4:"user";s:0:"";s:7:"creator";s:0:"";s:11:"last_change";a:10:{s:4:"date";i:1760534216;s:2:"ip";s:9:"127.0.0.1";s:4:"type";s:1:"C";s:2:"id";s:49:"resources:case_studies:financial_securities:case4";s:4:"user";s:0:"";s:3:"sum";s:23:"created - external edit";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";s:10:"sizechange";i:5022;s:9:"timestamp";i:1760534216;s:4:"mode";s:4:"page";}}}